WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:07.520
Are you a member of the Galactic Empire?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.620
Am I being detained?

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:09.780
Because I know my rights.

00:00:09.780 --> 00:00:12.640
My partner there is telling me that his womp
rat has signalled on your vehicle.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:16.340
That is bullsh- your partner just tapped my
speeder-

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:19.720
Step out of the speeder, and I'm going to
need to see your identification.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.640
You don't need to see my identification.

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:34.600
I rise to speak until I can speak no more
about this government's unauthorized use

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.960
of droid strikes.

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.580
You can't be the guy who builds this,

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.080
you can't be the corporation that builds this.

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:44.240
You have to be an empire to build something
like this.

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:46.140
It takes government leadership,

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:49.300
to build a battle station the size of a moon

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.280
that can obliterate inhabited planets.

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.040
And it doesn't matter if it's bulk metadata
or not

00:00:57.040 --> 00:01:01.980
who you're sending holograms to is information
about you and your personal life.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:04.860
Where are those transmissions you intercepted?

00:01:04.860 --> 00:01:07.660
Well, in my defense I'm not handling anything
anymore

00:01:07.660 --> 00:01:08.760
that's been passed to the journalists.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.780
You are part of the rebel alliance and a traitor.

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:19.080
There are 14 individuals frozen in carbonite,
20 years latter,

00:01:19.080 --> 00:01:20.740
and they've never had a trial.

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:25.280
Commence eminent domain.

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:33.040
Let's at least audit the Imperial Reserve.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.540
I'm just saying it's a slippery slope from
gay marriage to incest,

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:48.240
I swear to you I just saw a woman kissing
her own brother.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:52.980
I have apologized for saying 'sand people'
in my older news letters,

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:54.620
that was a different time,

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:59.420
I want you to know that today I have many
indigenous Tuskan peoples

00:01:59.440 --> 00:02:02.460
on my staff and as my friends.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.220
Ten thousand, all in advance.

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:07.160
Ten thousand?

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.660
Could almost buy our own ship for that.

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.539
The government has increased the cost of risk

00:02:10.539 --> 00:02:14.430
and so our supplier is increasing the cost
of his services.

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:17.200
It's basic economics Luke.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:18.620
We're gonna do a little bit of light saber
work

00:02:18.620 --> 00:02:21.340
and then I'm gonna have you read a lot of
Milton Friedman.

00:02:21.880 --> 00:02:28.440
The Imperial Environmental Protection Agency
has sixty thousand storm troopers.

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:33.920
Why do they need imperial walkers to protect
forestation on Endor?

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.320
The only thing that can stop a bad guy with 
a gun,

00:03:05.320 --> 00:03:08.360
is a good guy with a gun who shoots first.

